      "fontFamily": "Inter",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "lineHeight": 16,
      "gap": 12
    }
  },
  "prompt": "Create the 100 named app icons in the supplied schematic. For generation, supply the schematic first and a style reference second. For editing, supply the existing atlas first and the schematic second; preserve the existing icon artwork and change only its geometry. Use dark rounded tiles, crisp silver symbols, restrained colorful gradients, and internal depth. All 100 tiles must be exact 1:1 squares of the same size, with consistent corner radii and symbol scales. Each tile's bounding box must equal its specified image rectangle, with zero inset and no exterior shadow. Preserve the schematic's canvas margins, gaps, positions, sizes, order, and captions exactly. Match the schematic background outside tiles. Remove guide outlines. Do not recenter or reflow. If output resolution differs, scale both axes of the entire schematic by the same factor. Rounded corners may expose background only inside their rectangle.",
